{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026LvfFYrTazr1794691771.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>中共中央政治局委員，國務院副總理何立峰在深圳，出席亞太經合組織工商諮詢理事會第四次會議開幕式。</p><p></p><p>何立峰昨日在開幕式致辭時說，亞太經合領導人非正式會議即將在深圳舉行，為亞太合作明確方向、凝聚力量。希望工商諮詢理事會繼續發揚開拓進取、開放創新的企業家精神，推動亞太經合向著構建亞太共同體目標再啟航，為亞太區域協同合作、創新發展、互聯互通做出新的貢獻。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-14T22:31:54.310933+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":173,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-14T17:04:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-15T01:26:44.658095+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-14T22:25:03.164463+00:00","content_hash":"a1c66cd437828cc6606e8aa0cb9e3ac80c5e98589dd01803aae9628dbfddbce4","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-14T22:31:54.310933+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}